  "content_html": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/assets/images/content/ba93be8bb6d53b3064.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img alt=\"בקבוקוני בושם וציור של ראש\" border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"217\" data-original-width=\"650\" height=\"134\" src=\"/assets/images/content/ba93be8bb6d53b3064.jpg\" width=\"400\" /></a></div><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">תמונה טמונה</span></h2><div><h3><div style=\"font-size: medium; font-weight: 400;\"></div><p style=\"font-size: medium; font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">איזה אובייקט מהפרשה מרומז בתמונת הפוסט?</span></p></h3></div><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">ביטוי מקראי</span></h2><div><div><h3><div style=\"font-size: medium; font-weight: 400;\"></div><p style=\"font-size: medium; font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מצאו את הביטויים המקראיים השזורים בידיעות העיתונאיות הבאות:</span></p><p style=\"font-size: medium; font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial; font-size: large;\"></span></p><p style=\"background-color: white; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: medium; font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"></span></span></p><p style=\"font-size: medium; font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">1📰</span></p><p style=\"font-size: medium; font-weight: 400;\"></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/assets/images/content/5f0be66a7b47da4b83.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"502\" data-original-width=\"208\" height=\"400\" src=\"/assets/images/content/5f0be66a7b47da4b83.jpg\" width=\"166\" /></a></div><br /><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">2📰<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/assets/images/content/46a11fbcc8d85b4624.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"241\" data-original-width=\"159\" src=\"/assets/images/content/46a11fbcc8d85b4624.jpg\" /></a></div><br /></span><p></p></h3></div><p><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">3📰</span></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><a href=\"/assets/images/content/235cbfe0097abd7ff2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"136\" data-original-width=\"151\" src=\"/assets/images/content/235cbfe0097abd7ff2.jpg\" /></a></span></div><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span><p></p><p><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">4📰</span></p><p></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/assets/images/content/bd50a87c8b110a7047.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"380\" data-original-width=\"219\" height=\"400\" src=\"/assets/images/content/bd50a87c8b110a7047.jpg\" width=\"230\" /></a></div><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">מדרגאות</span></h2><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span class=\"KB0Tx C9DxTc\"><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: large; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-ligatures: none; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 1.6667; margin: 12px 0px 0px; outline: none; padding-bottom: 0px; position: relative; text-decoration-line: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 צמח תבלין<br /></span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 נעשה חולה<br /></span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 קרקע בירושה<br /></span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 מסממני הקטורת (מהפרשה)\n</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 עוסק במשק החלב\n</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 חוט עבה\n</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 רטוב</span></span></p></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">פתרונות</span></h3><h3 style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">תמונה טמונה</span></h3><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">\"</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וְאַתָּה קַח לְךָ <span style=\"background-color: #ffa400;\"><b>בְּשָׂמִים רֹאשׁ</b></span>\"</span></p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><h3 style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">ביטוי מקראי</span></h3></span><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">1:&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">\"כֹּל הָעֹבֵר עַל הַפְּקֻדִים מִבֶּן <span style=\"background-color: #ffa400;\"><b>עֶשְׂרִים שָׁנָה</b></span> וָמָעְלָה\"</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">2:&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">\"וְקִדָּה חֲמֵשׁ מֵאוֹת בְּשֶׁקֶל הַקֹּדֶשׁ <span style=\"background-color: #ffa400;\"><b>וְשֶׁמֶן זַיִת</b></span> הִין\"</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">3: \"</span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">רְאֵה קָרָאתִי בְשֵׁם בְּצַלְאֵל בֶּן אוּרִי <span style=\"background-color: #ffa400;\"><b>בֶן חוּר</b></span>\"</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">4:&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">\"וְשָׁמְרוּ בְנֵי יִשְׂרָאֵל אֶת הַשַּׁבָּת לַעֲשׂוֹת אֶת הַשַּׁבָּת לְדֹרֹתָם <span style=\"background-color: #ffa400;\"><b>בְּרִית עוֹלָם</b></span>\"</span></p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><h3 style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium; font-variant-ligatures: none; text-decoration-line: inherit;\">מדרגאות</span></h3><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-variant-ligatures: none; text-decoration-line: inherit;\">הל, חלה, נחלה, חלבנה, חלבן, חבל, לח<br /></span></p></span></div></div>"
